---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Laije Belthassar BALONG, analyse métier et maîtrise d'ouvrage"
  description="Portfolio de Laije Belthassar BALONG, Business Analyst à Brazzaville. Analyse métier et maîtrise d'ouvrage, du recueil du besoin à la recette."
>

<section class="hero">
<div class="hero__main">
<h1 class="hero__title">Analyse métier et maîtrise d'ouvrage<span class="accent-dot">.</span></h1>
<p class="hero__lead"></p>
<p class="hero__sub"></p>
<div class="hero__actions">
<a href="#projets" class="btn btn--main">Voir les projets</a>
<a href="mailto:laijebalong@gmail.com" class="btn btn--line">Me contacter</a>
</div>
</div>
<figure class="hero__figure">
<div class="photo-ph" role="img" aria-label="Emplacement de la photo de Laije Belthassar BALONG">
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="3.8" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><path d="M4.5 20.5c0-4.1 3.4-7 7.5-7s7.5 2.9 7.5 7" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path d="M9.5 20.5h5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<span class="photo-ph__note">[Votre photo, format 4 x 5]</span>
</div>
<figcaption class="hero__caption"><span>Laije Belthassar BALONG</span><span>Brazzaville</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>

<section class="method" aria-labelledby="methode">
<h2 class="method__title" id="methode">De la demande à la livraison</h2>
<p class="method__sub">Chaque étape renvoie au projet qui la prouve.</p>
<div class="method__grid">
<div class="step">
<span class="step__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<svg class="step__icon" aria-hidden="true" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 4.5h12A2 2 0 0 1 19 6.5v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-6l-4.5 3.5v-3.5H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path d="M7 8.5h8M7 11.5h4.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<p class="step__title">Recueillir le besoin</p>
<p class="step__desc">Entretiens, Business Case et BRD.</p>
<a href="/projet-ndako-tech" class="lnk step__link">Ndako Tech</a>
</div>
<div class="step">
<span class="step__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<svg class="step__icon" aria-hidden="true" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="5" rx="1.2" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect><rect x="14.5" y="15.5" width="7" height="5" rx="1.2" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2.5" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><path d="M9.5 6h6M6 8.5v5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h6.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<p class="step__title">Modéliser le processus</p>
<p class="step__desc">BPMN, couloirs, décisions, exceptions.</p>
<a href="/projet-ouverture-compte" class="lnk step__link">Ouverture de compte</a>
</div>
<div class="step">
<span class="step__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<svg class="step__icon" aria-hidden="true" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3.5 6h8M3.5 10h6M3.5 14h4"></path><path d="M13 20.5l-3.2.7.7-3.2 7.8-7.8a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 2.5 2.5z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path d="M16.8 11.5l2.5 2.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<p class="step__title">Rédiger les exigences</p>
<p class="step__desc">User stories priorisées en MoSCoW.</p>
<a href="/projet-ndako-tech" class="lnk step__link">Ndako Tech</a>
</div>
<div class="step step--done">
<span class="step__dot step__dot--done" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<svg class="step__icon" aria-hidden="true" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 5H7A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 5.5 6.5v13A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 7 21h10a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5-1.5v-13A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 17 5h-2" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="4" rx="1" fill="#F1F4F2"></rect><path d="M9 13.5l2 2 4-4" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg>
<p class="step__title">Vérifier par la recette</p>
<p class="step__desc">Cas de test, anomalies, décision.</p>
<a href="/projet-ndako-tech" class="lnk step__link">Ndako Tech</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="home-projets" id="projets">
<div class="home-head">
<h2 class="home-h2">Projets</h2>
<a href="/projets" class="lnk home-head__link">Tous les projets</a>
</div>

<div class="home-cards">

<article class="card proj-card" id="bpmn">
<figure class="proj-card__media">
<svg class="bpmn-svg" viewBox="0 0 860 300" role="img" aria-label="Schéma BPMN simplifié de l'ouverture d'un compte, en trois couloirs : client, agence, conformité">
<defs><marker id="fl" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#5B6160"></path></marker></defs>
<rect x="0.5" y="0.5" width="859" height="299" rx="10" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#D5DCD7"></rect>
<line x1="96" y1="0" x2="96" y2="300" stroke="#D5DCD7"></line>
<line x1="0" y1="100" x2="860" y2="100" stroke="#D5DCD7" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line>
<line x1="0" y1="200" x2="860" y2="200" stroke="#D5DCD7" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line>
<text x="16" y="55" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#5B6160">Client</text>
<text x="16" y="155" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#5B6160">Agence</text>
<text x="16" y="255" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#5B6160">Back-office</text>
<circle cx="124" cy="50" r="9" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
<path d="M133 50 H148" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<rect x="150" y="28" width="108" height="44" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#B9C6BE"></rect>
<text x="204" y="47" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">Se renseigner,</text>
<text x="204" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">réunir les pièces</text>
<path d="M258 50 H310 V126" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<rect x="256" y="128" width="108" height="44" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#B9C6BE"></rect>
<text x="310" y="147" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">Vérifier</text>
<text x="310" y="162" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">les pièces</text>
<path d="M364 150 H398" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<polygon points="420,128 442,150 420,172 398,150" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon>
<text x="420" y="190" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#4A504E">Pièces conformes ?</text>
<path d="M420 128 V76" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<text x="428" y="66" font-size="11" fill="#5B6160">non : revenir avec les pièces</text>
<path d="M442 150 H500 V226" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<text x="452" y="143" font-size="11" fill="#5B6160">oui</text>
<rect x="446" y="228" width="108" height="44" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#B9C6BE"></rect>
<text x="500" y="247" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">Filtrage et</text>
<text x="500" y="262" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">risque</text>
<path d="M554 250 H588" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<polygon points="610,228 632,250 610,272 588,250" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon>
<text x="610" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#4A504E">Contrôle validé ?</text>
<path d="M632 250 H700 V74" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<text x="642" y="243" font-size="11" fill="#5B6160">oui</text>
<rect x="646" y="28" width="108" height="44" rx="8" fill="#3F6B57"></rect>
<text x="700" y="47" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#FFFFFF">Retirer</text>
<text x="700" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#FFFFFF">la carte</text>
<path d="M754 50 H806" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<circle cx="818" cy="50" r="10" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="3"></circle>
</svg>
<figcaption class="proj-card__cap">Vue simplifiée. L'étude complète compte 9 étapes, 2 décisions et les exceptions du back-office, tracées en pointillés.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="proj-card__text">
<p class="proj-card__tags">
<span class="tag tag--accent tag--strong">Modélisation BPMN</span>
<span class="tag tag--neutral">Étude personnelle, octobre 2026</span>
</p>
<h3 class="proj-card__title">Ouverture d'un compte particulier en agence</h3>
<p class="proj-card__desc">Où un client perd-il du temps pour ouvrir un compte ? J'ai modélisé le parcours supposé d'après la réglementation CEMAC et la ligne directrice COBAC n° 1-2025, sans donnée interne de banque.</p>
<dl class="mini-stats">
<div><dt class="mini-stats__label">Couloirs</dt><dd class="mini-stats__num">3</dd></div>
<div><dt class="mini-stats__label">Points à vérifier</dt><dd class="mini-stats__num">4</dd></div>
<div><dt class="mini-stats__label">Pistes MoSCoW</dt><dd class="mini-stats__num">5</dd></div>
</dl>
<a href="/projet-ouverture-compte" class="lnk proj-card__cta">Lire l'étude</a>
</div>
</article>

<article class="card proj-card proj-card--reverse" id="ndako">
<div class="proj-card__panel">
<div class="viz-box">
<p class="viz-box__label">32 user stories, priorisées en MoSCoW</p>
<div class="moscow" role="img" aria-label="19 Must, 7 Should, 5 Could, 1 socle">
<span class="moscow__must"></span>
<span class="moscow__should"></span>
<span class="moscow__could"></span>
<span class="moscow__base"></span>
</div>
<p class="moscow__legend"><span><strong>19</strong> Must</span><span><strong>7</strong> Should</span><span><strong>5</strong> Could</span><span><strong>1</strong> socle</span></p>
</div>
<div class="viz-box">
<p class="viz-box__label">Recette</p>
<div class="recette-grid">
<div><p class="recette__num">34</p><p class="recette__label">cas de test</p></div>
<div><p class="recette__num">6</p><p class="recette__label">anomalies</p></div>
<div><p class="recette__num">2</p><p class="recette__label">bloquantes</p></div>
</div>
<p class="recette__foot">Décision : recette défavorable.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="proj-card__text proj-card__text--reverse">
<p class="proj-card__tags">
<span class="tag tag--accent tag--strong">Exigences et recette</span>
<span class="tag tag--neutral">Projet d'équipe, octobre 2026</span>
</p>
<h3 class="proj-card__title">Ndako Tech</h3>
<p class="proj-card__desc">Plateforme de recherche de logement. Lead Business Analyst d'une squad de 9 : Business Case, BRD, FRD, user stories, cahier de recette et matrice de traçabilité.</p>
<p class="proj-card__desc">La recette a été prononcée défavorable : le contrôle a joué son rôle avant la mise en ligne.</p>
<div class="proj-card__links">
<a href="/projet-ndako-tech" class="lnk proj-card__cta">Lire le projet</a>
<a href="https://ndakotech.onrender.com" class="lnk">Voir le site</a>
</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="card proj-card">
<div class="proj-card__panel">
<div class="kpi-grid">
<div class="viz-box"><p class="viz-box__label">Unités vendues</p><p class="kpi__num">58 118</p></div>
<div class="viz-box"><p class="viz-box__label">Profit</p><p class="kpi__num">78,4 M$</p></div>
</div>
<div class="viz-box">
<p class="viz-box__label">Retours SAV analysés par</p>
<p class="viz-box__tags">
<span class="tag tag--accent">Modèle</span>
<span class="tag tag--accent">Système concerné</span>
<span class="tag tag--accent">Sentiment client</span>
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="proj-card__text">
<p class="proj-card__tags">
<span class="tag tag--accent tag--strong">Données</span>
<span class="tag tag--neutral">TP certifiant IBM</span>
</p>
<h3 class="proj-card__title">Tableau de bord ventes et SAV</h3>
<p class="proj-card__desc">Deux pages sous Looker Studio pour un constructeur automobile fictif : suivre les ventes et comprendre les retours du service après-vente.</p>
<a href="/projet-tableau-de-bord" class="lnk proj-card__cta">Lire le projet</a>
</div>
</article>

</div>
</section>

<section class="home-parcours" id="parcours">
<div class="home-head">
<h2 class="home-h2">Parcours</h2>
<a href="/parcours" class="lnk home-head__link">Parcours complet et certifications</a>
</div>
<div class="home-tl">

<div class="tl-card">
<h3 class="home-tl__title">Expérience</h3>
<ol class="timeline">
<li class="timeline__item">
<span class="timeline__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<p class="timeline__date">Depuis août 2026</p>
<div class="timeline__body">
<p class="timeline__role">Brand Ambassadeur</p>
<p class="timeline__org">MTN Skills Academy, Fondation MTN Congo</p>
<p class="timeline__detail">Plus de 25 personnes accompagnées, jusqu'à plus de 600 certificats.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="timeline__item timeline__item--last">
<span class="timeline__dot timeline__dot--open" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<p class="timeline__date timeline__date--muted">Mai à juin 2026</p>
<div class="timeline__body">
<p class="timeline__role">Analyste testeur</p>
<p class="timeline__org">African Global Multiservice Consulting</p>
<p class="timeline__detail">Audit d'un site web, scénarios de test, suivi des anomalies.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
</div>

<div class="tl-card tl-card--muted">
<h3 class="home-tl__title">Formation</h3>
<ol class="timeline timeline--muted">
<li class="timeline__item">
<span class="timeline__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<p class="timeline__date">Depuis juin 2026</p>
<div class="timeline__body">
<p class="timeline__role">Business Analyst</p>
<p class="timeline__org">Akieni Academy</p>
<p class="timeline__detail">Formation professionnelle en analyse métier, études de cas en équipe.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="timeline__item timeline__item--last">
<span class="timeline__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<p class="timeline__date">2025 à 2028</p>
<div class="timeline__body">
<p class="timeline__role">Licence Réseaux et Télécommunications (En cours)</p>
<p class="timeline__org">IPH, Brazzaville</p>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
</div>

</div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* Hero */
.hero { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 48px 64px; padding: 88px 0; }
.hero__main { flex: 999 1 520px; min-width: 0; }
.hero__title { margin: 0; max-width: 16ch; font-weight: 600; font-size: 68px; line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.035em; }
.hero__lead { margin: 28px 0 0; max-width: 56ch; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-ink); }
.hero__sub { margin: 16px 0 0; max-width: 56ch; font-size: 17px; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.hero__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-top: 36px; }
.hero__figure { flex: 0 1 300px; max-width: 300px; margin: 0; }
.photo-ph {
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  border-radius: 28px;
  background: var(--color-surface-muted);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 14px;
}
.photo-ph__note { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }
.hero__caption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }

/* Méthode */
.method { padding: 40px; margin-bottom: var(--space-section-lg); border-radius: var(--radius-card); background: var(--color-surface-muted); }
.method__title { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
.method__sub { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }
.method__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 32px 0; margin-top: 36px; }
.step { position: relative; padding: 24px 24px 0 0; border-top: 2px solid #C9D7CE; }
.step--done { padding-right: 0; border-top-color: var(--color-accent); }
.step__dot {
  position: absolute;
  top: -7px;
  left: 0;
  width: 12px;
  height: 12px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--color-surface-muted);
  border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.step__dot--done { background: var(--color-accent); border: 0; }
.step__icon { display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.step__title { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; }
.step__desc { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.step__link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; }

/* Bloc Projets de l'accueil */
.home-projets { padding-bottom: var(--space-section-lg); }
.home-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
.home-h2 { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
.home-head__link { font-size: 15px; }
.home-cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }

.proj-card { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; padding: 24px; border-radius: var(--radius-card); background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
.proj-card--reverse { flex-direction: row-reverse; }
.proj-card__media { flex: 3 1 480px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 24px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-surface-muted); }
.bpmn-svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; font-family: var(--font-sans); }
.proj-card__cap { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }
.proj-card__panel { flex: 3 1 480px; min-width: 0; padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-surface-muted); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
.proj-card__text { flex: 2 1 300px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 8px 8px 8px 0; }
.proj-card__text--reverse { padding: 8px 0 8px 8px; }
.proj-card__tags { margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.proj-card__title { margin: 20px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.proj-card__desc { margin: 12px 0 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.proj-card__cta { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 24px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; }
.proj-card__links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 24px; }
.proj-card__links .proj-card__cta { margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }

.mini-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 24px 0 0; }
.mini-stats__label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }
.mini-stats__num { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 24px; }

/* Vignettes de données (illustration) */
.viz-box { padding: 20px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid #D5DCD7; }
.viz-box__label { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }
.viz-box__tags { margin: 10px 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.moscow { display: flex; gap: 4px; height: 14px; margin-top: 12px; }
.moscow span { border-radius: 4px; }
.moscow__must { flex: 19; background: #3F6B57; }
.moscow__should { flex: 7; background: #8FAE9C; }
.moscow__could { flex: 5; background: #C9D7CE; }
.moscow__base { flex: 1; background: #17191A; }
.moscow__legend { margin: 10px 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 20px; font-size: 14px; }
.moscow__legend strong { font-weight: 600; }
.recette-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 10px; }
.recette__num { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.recette__label { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-subtle); }
.recette__foot { margin: 14px 0 0; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.kpi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.kpi__num { margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; }

/* Bloc Parcours de l'accueil */
